<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-US">

<!-- @pageTitle = Oligo Space -->

<!-- @include "global/head.kit"-->

<body class="project-page">
    <!-- @include "global/header_nav.kit" -->

    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="title-frame margins">
                <h1 class="project-title puzzle-type puzzle-auto" data-vertical-align="bottom">Oligo Space</h1>
                <h5>Bringing wonder back to space</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="vimeo-video hero-image" id="OLI1" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli1_logo-animation_fallback.jpg');padding:61.67% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225085834?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli1_logo-animation">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <!-- NOTE: tags are not present in the Figma frame — placeholders below -->
            <div class="tags-frame margins">
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Logo</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Strategy</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="tag">
                    <p>Brand</p>
                    <div class="squares"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="adjectives margins">
                <p>curious</p>
                <p>diverse</p>
                <p>intellectual</p>
                <p>modular</p>
                <p>genuine</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="intro margins">
            <h5>
                While many satellite companies lean into repeatability with copy-paste designs, Oligo Space is unique for every client, bringing wonder back to the space industry. Oligo is a design and manufacturing company in Los Angeles that creates custom satellites for a wide array of&nbsp;businesses.
            </h5>
        </section>
        <section class="content margins" id="oligo-space">
            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="OLI2" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli2_gradient-banner_fallback.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225088183?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli2_gradient-banner">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <p class="width6 narrow-text">
                We worked with Oligo’s team to position them as <span class="italics">The Mad Scientist</span>: a brand strategy and identity that champions unorthodox ideas. It captures how Oligo relentlessly tinkers, dreams, and&nbsp;grows.
            </p>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli3_billboard.jpg" alt="Billboard reading “No idea is just an idea.”" class="width6" id="OLI3">
            <div class="vimeo-video width4" id="OLI4" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli4_logo-construction_fallback.jpg');padding:73.87% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225088333?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli4_logo-construction">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <p class="width2">
                The logo depicts the intangible Aether material orbiting the center dot like a satellite orbiting&nbsp;Earth.
            </p>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli5_logo-site.jpg" alt="Logo shown among other private spaceflight company marks" class="width3 align-bottom" id="OLI5">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli6_phone.jpg" alt="Logo on a phone screen" class="width3" id="OLI6">
            <!-- Figma right-aligns this width4 with 2 empty columns to its left. No existing
                 puzzle piece offsets a row, so the start column is set inline (ignored on mobile). -->
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli7_lab.jpg" alt="Technicians in cleanroom suits working on a satellite" class="width4" id="OLI7" style="grid-column:3 / span 4;">
            <div class="vimeo-video width3" id="OLI8" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli8_chase-the-aether_fallback.jpg');padding:100% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225088460?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli8_chase-the-aether">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="small-img width3">
                <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli9_lanyard.jpg" alt="Branded lanyard badge on a wall" id="OLI9">
            </div>
            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="OLI10" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli10_tool-demo_fallback.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225088612?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli10_tool-demo">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <p class="width6 narrow-text">
                We developed a tool to produce bespoke, stylized gradients inspired by wind tunnel tests and the ethereal atmosphere of&nbsp;space.
            </p>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli11_satellite.jpg" alt="Satellite schematic illustration" class="width6" id="OLI11">
            <p class="width2">
                We helped Oligo communicate both their software and hardware capabilities to an audience of businesses that have never worked with space manufacturing by baking this relationship into every aspect of the&nbsp;identity.
            </p>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli12_business-cards.jpg" alt="Business cards in four gradient colorways" class="width4" id="OLI12">
            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="OLI13" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli13_hardware-software_fallback.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225088836?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli13_hardware-software">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="vimeo-video width2 align-top-left" id="OLI14" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli14_typeface-carousel_fallback.jpg');padding:100% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225088966?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli14_typeface-carousel">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli15_colors.jpg" alt="Grid of Davos poster colorways" class="width4" id="OLI15">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli16_laptop.jpg" alt="Website contact page on a laptop" class="width3" id="OLI16">
            <p class="width6 narrow-text">
                We utilized Nippo and Chillax as typefaces to represent both sides of the company, and overlapped them to create a library of shapes that allude to Oligo’s custom satellites. These forms provide a range of usage from expressive information to full&nbsp;compositions.
            </p>
            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="OLI17" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli17_overlap-pieces_fallback.jpg');padding:48.48% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225089067?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli17_overlap-pieces">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli18_banner.jpg" alt="Street hoarding banner reading “Launching in…”" class="width6" id="OLI18">
            <div class="vimeo-video width3" id="OLI19" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli19_corners_fallback.jpg');padding:135.38% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225089540?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli19_corners">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli24_tote.jpg" alt="Branded tote bag on a chair" class="width3 align-bottom" id="OLI24">
            <div class="vimeo-video width2 align-top-left" id="OLI20" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli20_orbiting-type_fallback.jpg');padding:100% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225089754?background=1&autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli20_orbiting-type">
                </iframe>
            </div>
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli21_building.jpg" alt="Building wrap reading “Making Space For Everyone”" class="width4" id="OLI21">
            <img src="assets/project-pages/OLI/oli22_presentation.jpg" alt="Presentation slides" class="width6" id="OLI22">
            <p class="width6 narrow-text">
                Working with the Oligo team was one of our favorite processes so far. We love brands that are rooted in big-picture personality and allow us to get in the weeds on every little&nbsp;detail.
            </p>
            <!-- Sizzle reel uses Vimeo's normal player, not the background player-->
            <div class="vimeo-video width6" id="OLI23" style="--poster:url('assets/vimeo-thumbnails/OLI/oli23_sizzle-reel_fallback.jpg');padding:56.25% 0 0 0;">
                <iframe
                    data-src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1225089917?autoplay=1&loop=1&muted=1&controls=1&playsinline=1&title=0&byline=0&portrait=0"
                    frameborder="0"
                    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture;"
                    title="oli23_sizzle-reel"
                    style="pointer-events:auto;">
                </iframe>
            </div>
        </section>
        <!-- @include "global/components/next-project.kit" -->

        <!-- @include "global/footer.kit" -->


    </main>
    <!-- @import "global/scripts.kit"-->

</body>

</html>
